  <item>
    <title>古时代玩团荒谬史，到更年期前的烦恼与体悟 feat. Tizzy Bac</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2ada77028e84948f292af6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a2ada77028e84948f292af6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 17:22:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 5/9 Tizzy Bac 最终限定场演唱会，ACOUSTIC全新编曲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a> 说出我的名字的重新定义，想说出其实是自己的名字</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a> 认识20多年，前源觉得小玉的变化</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 始终摇滚的TB，最大的转变是惠婷会跳舞了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 年轻人还组团吗？ 现在玩团还酷吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 音乐祭安排的住宿竟然是住「香客大楼」！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a> Tizzy Bac 和宇宙人，小时候玩团的荒谬史</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> 大爆料：旺福小民在台上唱到睡着？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">27:27</a> 巡演主办安排住爱情旅馆，透明的淋浴间要怎么洗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 有如八点档的剧情，音乐祭上看到的感情冲突</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> Tizzy Bac组团这么久，彼此是五等亲的存在</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a> 惠婷最爱的一段圣经，长大之后才能真的体悟：约翰一书 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">4:18</a></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a> 内在小孩就像小孩穿西装，长大到一定程度就能撑起来</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3122">52:02</a> 演唱会你可以站多久，站着跟坐着的观众，对于演出者的影响</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3954">01:05:54</a> 自己长大了以后，才认知到不长大的开心</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">01:10:00</a> 前源印象深刻的路人，到底是看到人还是阿飘？</span></p><p><span>如果你觉得我们的节目有趣</span><br><span>想与我们分享故事</span><br><span>或是合作邀约</span><br><span>欢迎寄信到</span><br><span>passerby0208@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
